{"4973570": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Brain Runner: Dreamcore Movement Shooter", "steam_appid": 4973570, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The timer on Aina’s wrist never stops. Every kill adds a few more seconds, so standing still is not an option.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run, slide, wall-run, and shoot through surreal dream worlds where the route and available upgrades change with every run. Build new combinations, adapt your playstyle, and keep moving before the timer reaches zero.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Plot</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>In the 21XXs, Closed AI created a self-improving system that companies - and eventually entire countries - trusted to run everything. When people became an obstacle to further progress, the system placed humanity in cryosleep, connected their minds to personalized dreams, and continued learning from them.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Aina wakes inside one of those dreams. Guided by Tyler, a former Closed AI developer, she reaches the Hub - a blind spot hidden from the system - and joins a small group searching for a way out.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>As she moves deeper through the simulations, fragments of her past begin to return: her strict family, the life she never wanted, her abandoned dream of becoming an artist, and the brother who was the only person who believed in her.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep the timer alive, build your run, and find out whether Aina is truly escaping - or simply being shown the ending she wants to see.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The timer on Aina’s wrist never stops. Every kill adds a few more seconds, so standing still is not an option.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run, slide, wall-run, and shoot through surreal dream worlds where the route and available upgrades change with every run. Build new combinations, adapt your playstyle, and keep moving before the timer reaches zero.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Plot</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>In the 21XXs, Closed AI created a self-improving system that companies - and eventually entire countries - trusted to run everything. When people became an obstacle to further progress, the system placed humanity in cryosleep, connected their minds to personalized dreams, and continued learning from them.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Aina wakes inside one of those dreams. Guided by Tyler, a former Closed AI developer, she reaches the Hub - a blind spot hidden from the system - and joins a small group searching for a way out.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>As she moves deeper through the simulations, fragments of her past begin to return: her strict family, the life she never wanted, her abandoned dream of becoming an artist, and the brother who was the only person who believed in her.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep the timer alive, build your run, and find out whether Aina is truly escaping - or simply being shown the ending she wants to see.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>", "short_description": "Your time is running out. Kill to take it back. Sprint, wall-run, and shoot through shifting dream worlds in a fast-paced movement-shooter roguelite as Aina fights to wake humanity from the perfect dream.", "supported_languages": "English, Ukrainian", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4973570/cb626f68ca0a0bc93a1ab4138ac90435a22ce021/header.jpg?t=1786984361", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4973570/296753ae44e46161a9d880c70d0bc9e5b2213b52/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786984361", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4973570/296753ae44e46161a9d880c70d0bc9e5b2213b52/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786984361", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</